ve-gram\", and so on.","topics":[],"score":229777,"global_rank":113339},{"name":"prismofeverything/organism-legacy","owner":"prismofeverything","html_url":"https://github.com/prismofeverything/organism-legacy","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":8,"language":"Python","description":"implementation of the organism board game","topics":[],"score":229758,"global_rank":113354},{"name":"kevinslin/dotfiles","owner":"kevinslin","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinslin/dotfiles","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Some helpful dotfiles","topics":[],"score":229740,"global_rank":113365},{"name":"sushiroll-206/Tanuki","owner":"sushiroll-206","html_url":"https://github.com/sushiroll-206/Tanuki","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Tanuki is a NLP powered Resume matcher that aims to increase the chance for  job seekers to land an interview. ","topics":[],"score":229737,"global_rank":113376},{"name":"rbavery/satlas-aoti","owner":"rbavery","html_url":"https://github.com/rbavery/satlas-aoti","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229737,"global_rank":113380},{"name":"rachelpeterson484/Leetcode-Questions","owner":"rachelpeterson484","html_url":"https://github.com/rachelpeterson484/Leetcode-Questions","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229737,"global_rank":113381},{"name":"camoverride/business_cards","owner":"camoverride","html_url":"https://github.com/camoverride/business_cards","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Business Card Printer","topics":[],"score":229737,"global_rank":113388},{"name":"maazghani/pywalker","owner":"maazghani","html_url":"https://github.com/maazghani/pywalker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Python toolset for indexing and querying codebases using OpenAI